[{"title":"杂咏 其二","author":"姚光虞","text":"我闻九方皋，相马沙丘北。\n所观以天机，安辩骊黄色。\n马既入秦庭，灭没若亡失。\n天閒尽不如，伯乐起叹息。\n世岂无皋俦，往往视形骨。\n遂令沃若步，垂老困伏枥。\n不见素王言，骥称匪由力。\n伟矣缠薪人，千载信神识。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12230,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏雪","author":"姚光虞","text":"城上寒云满翠微，四郊雨雪晚霏霏。\n忽惊万树梅俱放，转觉千门絮乱飞。\n高阁夜阑斜映烛，疏帘风入细沾衣。\n歌钟处处留欢赏，谁念袁安卧掩扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12231,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄永嘉刘郡丞","author":"姚光虞","text":"西粤风尘感昔游，别来又复忆东瓯。\n天涯知己谁青眼，世上浮名共白头。\n千里梦悬华盖月，一封书到冶城楼。\n剡溪延伫无多路，不得轻移雪夜舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12232,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得陈明佐书","author":"姚光虞","text":"尺素东来蜀道长，交游谁问老冯唐。\n官贫祇欠尊中酒，客久能添镜里霜。\n锦水曾闻遗圣迹，阆州何事断人肠。\n杜陵诗卷今犹在，为访桥西旧草堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12233,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别黄幼彰次韵","author":"姚光虞","text":"傍午何人此扣扃，携尊特过子云亭。\n天涯作客头俱白，世上看君眼独青。\n诗为穷愁工亦拙，酒于惜别醉还醒。\n南行紫气庾关满，谁倚青牛乞著经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12234,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和苏子仁暮春雨中登木末亭之作","author":"姚光虞","text":"木末何年此构亭，长林春雨昼冥冥。\n洲边二水兼天白，城上三山尽日青。\n古寺荒凉空落叶，游人聚散只浮萍。\n残碑衰草凭阑外，感慨尊前酒易醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12235,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送杨佥宪之云南","author":"姚光虞","text":"万里看君拥传行，夜郎天外见滇城。\n百蛮揽辔边尘静，六月飞霜宪府清。\n骢马声华留建业，碧鸡词赋起昆明。\n西南到日仍传檄，父老争迎汉长卿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12236,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送周国雍守顺庆","author":"姚光虞","text":"使君千骑拥朱幡，此去谁云蜀道难。\n列郡分符虞岳牧，前驱负弩汉衣冠。\n湓城月色扬舲渡，巫峡涛声倚剑看。\n行矣外台今不薄，循良卿相满长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12237,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄同年陈明佐","author":"姚光虞","text":"粤海频年信息疏，春来迁客意何如。\n蜀中旧草征蛮檄，白下今传谏猎书。\n长孺祇应留禁闼，安仁未拟赋閒居。\n珠江二月归鸿满，迟尔新篇为起予。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12238,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄同年杨孺培","author":"姚光虞","text":"闻尔江潭赋卜居，乾坤生计只樵渔。\n已知楚客伤兰佩，不向王门曳锦裾。\n归去独怜贫靖节，倦游谁识病相如。\n安期岩畔频回首，何日山中共结庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12239,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈库部守廉州","author":"姚光虞","text":"吴下才名沈隐侯，独骑紫马向南州。\n离筵晓落三山寺，征旆晴分四月秋。\n客到炎方春雨满，珠还沧海夜光浮。\n汉家铜柱今犹在，此去凭君一借筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12240,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉亭漫述","author":"姚光虞","text":"永夏池亭且啸敖，门前休问长蓬蒿。\n微官始信如鸡肋，散地今看似马曹。\n无客经时慵束带，有诗终日任挥毫。\n不妨寂寞长扃户，赢得清閒对浊醪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12241,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大司成王公邀集徐圜","author":"姚光虞","text":"上公别业敞秋筵，水榭山亭隐洞天。\n荡桨荷花红漾日，停杯修竹翠含烟。\n楼前钟阜当窗出，树杪秦淮带郭悬。\n何似西园开邺下，词人飞盖夜翩翩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12242,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡鸣寺同国学诸公登望","author":"姚光虞","text":"岧峣山寺挂城头，晚向山城上寺楼。\n万里潮声扬子渡，千门树色秣陵秋。\n僧从上界依云卧，客似南皮选胜游。\n临眺不堪重吊古，由来江左帝王州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12243,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡江舟次寄送桢伯致仕还里中 其一","author":"姚光虞","text":"楚江归客片帆悬，万里秋风兴浩然。\n岂谓扬雄疲执戟，已知苏晋欲逃禅。\n罗浮林壑双藜杖，珠海烟云一钓船。\n但使幽栖能避俗，何须三顷鉴湖田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12244,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡江舟次寄送桢伯致仕还里中 其二","author":"姚光虞","text":"有客抽簪去不还，清秋归卧大崙山。\n白云直欲寻真隐，青琐无心恋旧班。\n岁月催人双鬓短，乾坤任我一身閒。\n何时杖策朱明洞，四百峰峦尔共攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12245,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日","author":"姚光虞","text":"江北江南春去，园林无数花飞。\n萋萋芳草满路，何事王孙未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12246,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高门桥晚归","author":"姚光虞","text":"满路垂杨芳草，一溪流水落花。\n山边林木蓊郁，深处定有人家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12247,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高树","author":"姚光虞","text":"高树阴森覆大堤，归鸦无数夕阳啼。\n祇愁夜半狂风起，不得深枝自在栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12248,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长门怨","author":"姚光虞","text":"澹月疏星夜色深，长门鱼钥漏沉沉。\n翠华望断无消息，空听蛩螀彻晓吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12249,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"后宫词","author":"姚光虞","text":"珠箔罗帏梦不成，起来花底听残更。\n多情祇有长门月，夜夜瑶阶伴影行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12250,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"建宁道中感怀","author":"彭应乾","text":"行行烟树碧濛濛，万绿垂杨夹道中。\n晓雾细飞云欲堕，天风轻拂日初曈。\n鸟啼花落随时变，水色山光到处同。\n芳草不须怀故土，扬鞭马首任西东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12251,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"待月岭南第一楼","author":"黄志尹","text":"待月鲸楼客，中秋醉解酲。\n悬知今夜魄，不减昨宵明。\n药兔犹凝象，鸾娥未厌盈。\n翠华如复睹，重慰四难并。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12252,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海珠饯别 其一","author":"黄志尹","text":"暂把纶竿俯碧浔，故山回首隔云林。\n烟霞兴有巢由癖，猿鹤盟同岁月深。\n在野久忘弹铗念，临渊因起羡鱼心。\n晚潮逆浪兼天涌，真怕人间果陆沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12253,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海珠饯别 其二","author":"黄志尹","text":"客途秋月带愁看，此夜凭虚慰所欢。\n玉宇四空涵古刹，澄波千顷漾旃檀。\n羿娥有影归溟渤，和璧无因碎激湍。\n窃庆卑栖真得地，一区门外即江干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12254,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒李忠简公祠","author":"黄志尹","text":"龙图遗像背禅堂，具见丹心的向阳。\n四面洪涛涵正气，一庭明月自清光。\n生膺男爵无馀禄，殁著贤声有抗章。\n血食万年香火地，绳家名世代成行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12255,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小金山谒苏祠言别","author":"黄志尹","text":"金山京口旧称奇，郁郁灵洲但小之。\n鳌冠烟霞吟兴剧，蜃腾雄胜赏心驰。\n诸天慧日空王寺，振古高风学士祠。\n边岸帆樯真咫尺，往还翘首有遗思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12256,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厓山吊古","author":"黄志尹","text":"宋室沈沦事已终，英雄阳九叵成功。\n擎天力屈三仁仆，率土兵颓一旅空。\n乌鸟有情哺寄子，黔黎无计泣遗弓。\n华夷仰止层厓石，屹立洪涛逆浪中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12257,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮邱社怀赵太史","author":"黄志尹","text":"逸客尊开晚沐堂，堂前丛桂起相望。\n美人恰伴青春去，彩笔空悬白昼长。\n识面独惭歌下里，知音谁与究全唐。\n双溪三洞名山在，杖屦遨游自一方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12258,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉浮葛二仙入祀朱明馆","author":"黄志尹","text":"浮葛仙翁去不回，空遗玄像粤江隈。\n嵩山此日归陈迹，勾漏何年变劫灰。\n天上朋游联剑舄，人间香火共亭台。\n崇贤忽动幽栖想，奈蜕尘缘未有媒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12259,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱明馆","author":"黄志尹","text":"迟日携醪选胜游，扶筇重上紫烟楼。\n灵区未识群仙蜕，佳致先从一览收。\n南望即今输白雉，西瞻无复度青牛。\n临池共享升平醉，不记张衡有四愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12260,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮邱八景 其一 紫烟楼","author":"黄志尹","text":"高楼生紫烟，遍绕琅玕树。\n一出西郭门，仿佛函关路。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12261,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮邱八景 其二 晚沐堂","author":"黄志尹","text":"冠盖息尘鞅，晚登休沐堂。\n渔樵无旦暮，竟日得徜徉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12262,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮邱八景 其三 珊瑚井","author":"黄志尹","text":"池畔珊瑚井，井水通潮汐。\n潮见珊瑚波，汐见珊瑚石。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12263,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮邱八景 其四 大雅堂","author":"黄志尹","text":"大雅久不作，正声今在兹。\n虞廷赓歌日，山斗起遐思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12264,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮邱八景 其五 留舄亭","author":"黄志尹","text":"六合并于秦，仙踪从此去。\n遗亭亦俨然，玉舄知何处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12265,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮邱八景 其六 朱明馆","author":"黄志尹","text":"一从归粤社，仙馆日投閒。\n咫尺罗浮路，丹梯尚可攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12266,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮邱八景 其七 挹袖轩","author":"黄志尹","text":"渺渺蓬莱山，茫茫今古宙。\n洪厓曾否来，谩挹浮邱袖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12267,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮邱八景 其八 听笙亭","author":"黄志尹","text":"王子浮邱侣，罗浮宇内山。\n凤笙来往处，笙响落人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12268,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望罗浮","author":"黄志尹","text":"罗浮东望海天宽，四百峰头紫雾蟠。\n宦迹驱驰思拄笏，云林衰谢悔弹冠。\n共传幽境身堪老，祇恐尘心路改观。\n此去吕翁如邂逅，肯沿卢氏枕邯郸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12269,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游七星岩 其一","author":"黄志尹","text":"北斗悬岩日月旁，跻攀曾共憩云房。\n遥连碧渚疑银汉，聊当仙槎泛野航。\n昼永千峰函瑞彩，夜深诸岛竞寒芒。\n诘朝东逐罗浮路，回首烟霞自一方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12270,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游七星岩 其二","author":"黄志尹","text":"星岩洞壑转霏微，岛有流霞淑气归。\n近晓不随明月去，当空常伴白云飞。\n谈禅尽日充僧咀，听法移时淬客衣。\n仙尉投閒将老地，也曾卜筑傍渔矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12271,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游七星岩 其三","author":"黄志尹","text":"六十馀龄物外身，携儿岩壑避嚣尘。\n临期结侣皆名士，隔日逢僧即故人。\n入洞再搜前钻刻，缘厓犹认昨嶙峋。\n尚平已毕寻常累，拟倩归航一怆神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12272,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"镇海楼眺望","author":"黄志尹","text":"共倚层楼俯大荒，粤都形胜自金汤。\n神州望切丹心炯，化国恩深白日长。\n烟火万家周井牧，河山千里汉封疆。\n中原岂直秦关险，犹有东南百二强。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12273,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潞河闻长笛","author":"王凤翎","text":"帝里莺花隔翠微，短蓬长笛晚依依。\n天清洞府龙争吼，风细秦楼凤欲飞。\n江渚凄声生客况，关山晴色照人衣。\n可堪吹却梅花落，肠断天涯春又归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12274,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送岑省轩还东莞","author":"王凤翎","text":"握手初逢燕市中，笑随群侠竞相雄。\n倾尊夜醉卢沟月，说剑寒生易水风。\n倦足九衢怜跃马，归心万里羡冥鸿。\n湘兰沅芷如堪赠，好寄新栽碧水东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12275,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日观莲忆濂溪雅趣 其一","author":"王凤翎","text":"何年白社种青莲，君子堂开俨昔贤。\n逃暑共寻泉石约，采芳重结水云缘。\n郫筒香注流霞满，仙掌珠擎湛露圆。\n三径不知身已隐，尚从濂洛问真诠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12276,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日观莲忆濂溪雅趣 其二","author":"王凤翎","text":"习家池馆足留连，十丈重开玉井莲。\n清影半摇朱幕外，暗香微动绿漪前。\n披襟北海浑无暑，对酒南薰恰有缘。\n自别周郎谁是主，劳心空寄爱莲篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12277,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李聚吾父母转北司徒郎","author":"王凤翎","text":"才瞻棨戟下炎荒，又促公车入帝乡。\n画省含香新宠渥，金亭飞舄旧循良。\n延津剑拂秋霜肃，南海珠悬夜月光。\n东事正当戎马急，边储谁念转输忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12278,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠幕史粹公罢政归钓鳌台","author":"王凤翎","text":"懒从鹓序点朝班，万里金华一日还。\n白马青袍何意绪，江云川月足怡颜。\n鹰扬不入公车梦，鸥狎长随钓艇闲。\n笑我六鳌犹未试，相从溪上且观澜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12279,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万竹歌","author":"王凤翎","text":"昔贤所居雅爱竹，一竿两竿浑不俗。\n今见高人爱更多，百竿千竿犹未足。\n等閒种得万成林，一望幽森相映绿。\n满前君子皆虚心，出门岂谓交游独。\n松梅添此友成三，凤凰依之鸣各六。\n渭川曾埒万户侯，山阳不换千钟粟。\n寻芳尤记竹边来，过门不辨为谁屋。\n绿阴相与久盘桓，疑是淇园与共谷。\n清风时动声琅琅，恍然万籁宣亭毒。\n须臾瘦影横江干，此君形象都归目。\n平安从此报无穷，簇簇龙孙争吐玉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12280,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠幕史粹公罢政归钓鳌台","author":"王凤翀","text":"宦途清望许谁先，幕府功成遽息肩。\n老去丹心悬蓟北，归来幽事付溪边。\n烟光水色明春酒，浴鹭飞凫绕钓船。\n人事浮云总身外，一篷疏雨且高眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12281,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题舒中赐大尹种德传芳图","author":"王凤翔","text":"盛德人间不可名，笔端何以肖仪形。\n喜从玉树瞻东邑，始信灵根自建宁。\n桂子庭前时吐瑞，兰芽阶下日添荣。\n自怜先世深培植，得似名公大有声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12282,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游海珠寺 其一","author":"佘光裕","text":"步武珠台上，依稀傍紫宫。\n花明三岛近，烟没五云通。\n山色青涵渚，江流碧浸空。\n酒阑歌未罢，孤月上梧桐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12283,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游海珠寺 其二","author":"佘光裕","text":"雅爱江中寺，初秋物色清。\n波平鱼网下，风动客帆轻。\n剑气冲星落，珠光抱月明。\n相携今夜酒，喜得伴群英。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12284,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海珠同章昆冈节推宴分赋","author":"佘光裕","text":"珠树苍苍覆石台，十年游走又重来。\n江中楼阁云霄合，岛上烟霞昼夜开。\n登岸未成观海赋，泛舟深愧济川才。\n乡关望断愁无赖，日暮停杯思转哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12285,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登小金山","author":"佘光裕","text":"山腰古寺枕江流，李郭相从晚泊舟。\n一径烟霞开宝刹，两崖风雨护灵洲。\n海天岛屿当空出，泽国鱼龙并日游。\n独上妙高台上望，五云深处是神州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12286,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厓门怀古 其一","author":"佘光裕","text":"白昼冥冥烟雨霏，江山人事两全非。\n悲风落日寒潮急，独有云涛护宝衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12287,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厓门怀古 其二","author":"佘光裕","text":"翠华归去紫龙宫，北骑长驱朔漠风。\n万古冤魂遗恨在，空馀鲛泪洒英雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12288,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厓门怀古 其三","author":"佘光裕","text":"宋室逢厓王气终，鼋鳖窟作帝王宫。\n江山故苑今何在，百二雄图夕照中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12289,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厓门怀古 其四","author":"佘光裕","text":"沧海龙归彻九冥，堂堂正气满沧溟。\n皇图帝业俱消索，只有丹心照汗青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12290,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厓门怀古 其五","author":"佘光裕","text":"海上楼船战血红，何能一旅补天工。\n尘沙满地风波恶，衰草残烟断晚鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12291,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺 其一","author":"佘光裕","text":"巍峨朱宇倚崔嵬，上界天裁绝点埃。\n爱客岩花飞复舞，媚人山鸟去还来。\n云霞不扫禅房静，灯火常悬佛殿开。\n洞锁薜萝仙子去，独留明月印苍苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12292,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺 其二","author":"佘光裕","text":"梵王宫殿古飞来，人去江空帝子哀。\n石洞云深龙睡稳，松关风度鹤声回。\n奇花竞吐飘山阁，乱树斜翻护石台。\n往事惊心君莫问，玉环金锁总浮埃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12293,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将进酒","author":"佘光裕","text":"春风瑶席珍羞罗，满堂宾客冠峨峨。\n酒满琼卮泛绿波，徘徊一笑衰颜酡。\n劝君进酒莫蹉跎，百代光阴转掷梭。\n对镜忽惊鬓发疏，朝如青丝暮已皤。\n君不见阿房插天高崖峨，金楼锦殿皆楚戈。\n又不见珠房绣户成烟萝，魏苑台空乌鹊歌。\n翠华一去愁经过，芙蓉泣雨泪滂沱。\n人生不乐逝如何，贤达托体同山阿。\n黄金换酒莫辞多，功名富贵亦消磨。\n拔剑起舞影婆娑，眼花耳热侧弁俄。\n繁丝急管奏阳和，醉来枕席泰华窝。\n酒星光照山之薖，举杯对月邀嫦娥。\n量如万斛沛江河，那知世路皆险坡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12294,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻笛","author":"佘光裕","text":"月夜群声寂，高楼一笛长。\n穿云含律吕，横玉落宫商。\n鹤唳关山冷，龙吟水国凉。\n不堪肠断处，乡思折垂杨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":12295,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]